@startuml
[*] --> Start

Start --> UploadDocument : Upload Document
Start --> ManageDocuments : Manage Documents

UploadDocument --> CheckFileType : Check File Type
CheckFileType --> CheckFileSize : Check File Size
CheckFileSize --> SaveDocument : Save Document
SaveDocument --> [*] : Success

ManageDocuments --> ViewDocument : View Document
ManageDocuments --> EditDocument : Edit Document
ManageDocuments --> DeleteDocument : Delete Document
ManageDocuments --> MoveDocument : Move Document

ViewDocument --> [*] : Display Document

EditDocument --> SaveDocument : Save Changes
EditDocument --> [*] : Cancel Edit

DeleteDocument --> TrashDocument : Move to Trash
TrashDocument --> [*] : Document Deleted

MoveDocument --> ChangeFolder : Change Folder
ChangeFolder --> [*] : Document Moved

DeleteDocument --> [*] : Document Deleted

SecurityCheck --> [*] : Unauthorized
SecurityCheck --> UploadDocument : Authorized

@enduml
